## Scope of the Solution

### In Scope

- Digital customer identification & qualification
- Digital banking availability & activity assessment
- Personalized digital product recommendations
- Digital campaign configuration
- Customer recommendation engagement
- Campaign performance monitoring
- Engagement & conversion measurement

### Out of Scope

- Redesigning the existing cross-selling process
- Replacing existing communication channels
- Changing product eligibility criteria
- Changing pricing or approval workflows
- Developing AI/ML recommendation models
- Redesigning the mobile banking application
- Modifying the existing product application process


## How Success Is Measured

The proposed framework defines measures across five areas:

- **Digital Qualification** — Digital Qualification Rate
- **Customer Engagement** — Recommendation Engagement Rate
- **Campaign Conversion** — Campaign Conversion Rate
- **Campaign Effectiveness** — Campaign Performance
- **Future Improvement** — Campaign / Product Performance Trends


